      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194EF6726954C14E4B524D000A5DF27D938CFC8CB74E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "非常抱歉，\n您的錢似乎不夠付款……",
